---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Base title="About us and how we make money" description={`Who ${SITE.name} is for, how we stay independent and how we make money.`}>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p class="lede">Independent advice on electric vans and trucks, new and used, for tradespeople, small businesses and fleets. We cover diesel too, so you can compare.</p>
    <h2>How we make money</h2>
    <p>The site is free. We earn money in these ways:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Leasing and finance enquiries.</strong> If you ask for a quote through us, the broker may pay us a fee. It doesn't change the price you pay or how we rank deals.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate links.</strong> Some links to products like racking or accessories earn us a small commission.</li>
      <li><strong>Sponsorship.</strong> Some podcast episodes and videos are sponsored. We always say so.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Our rules</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We don't sell vans or trucks.</li>
      <li>Rankings and reviews are never for sale.</li>
      <li>We say when we're not sure, and when something has changed.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
